Minato's patch to frameworks/base's media/java/android/media/PlayerBase.java at android-15.0.0_r1 (Apache-2.0),
ADR-0060 e2e1: no audio service, and VirtualDeviceParams' two constants written as their values.

Why: Minato has no audio service (IAudioService is a compile-only stub), so getService() throws the RemoteException
each caller already takes as an unreachable service: the player is not tracked, as AudioService's playback
configurations are not kept. VirtualDeviceParams is not taken (its virtual sensors and their callbacks are not
either); PlayerBase reads only POLICY_TYPE_AUDIO (1) and DEVICE_POLICY_DEFAULT (0) from it.

--- a/media/java/android/media/PlayerBase.java
+++ b/media/java/android/media/PlayerBase.java
@@ -16,8 +16,6 @@
 
 package android.media;
 
-import static android.companion.virtual.VirtualDeviceParams.DEVICE_POLICY_DEFAULT;
-import static android.companion.virtual.VirtualDeviceParams.POLICY_TYPE_AUDIO;
 import static android.content.Context.DEVICE_ID_DEFAULT;
 import static android.media.AudioManager.AUDIO_SESSION_ID_GENERATE;
 
@@ -297,14 +295,10 @@
         }
     }
 
-    private static IAudioService getService()
+    private static IAudioService getService() throws RemoteException
     {
-        if (sService != null) {
-            return sService;
-        }
-        IBinder b = ServiceManager.getService(Context.AUDIO_SERVICE);
-        sService = IAudioService.Stub.asInterface(b);
-        return sService;
+        // Minato: no audio service tracks players, so each call answers as one that cannot reach it.
+        throw new RemoteException("no audio service");
     }
 
     /**
@@ -574,8 +568,8 @@
         }
 
         VirtualDeviceManager vdm = context.getSystemService(VirtualDeviceManager.class);
-        if (vdm == null || vdm.getDevicePolicy(deviceId, POLICY_TYPE_AUDIO)
-                == DEVICE_POLICY_DEFAULT) {
+        // Minato: VirtualDeviceParams' POLICY_TYPE_AUDIO (1) and DEVICE_POLICY_DEFAULT (0), the class not taken.
+        if (vdm == null || vdm.getDevicePolicy(deviceId, 1) == 0) {
             return AUDIO_SESSION_ID_GENERATE;
         }
 
